classDiagram
    class TalentMatchPipelineFacade {
        -models_loader
        -contextual_loader
        -justification_generator
        -lock: RLock
        -strategy: AdherenceScoreStrategy
        +analyze_resume(job, resume, requirements, config, strategy) dict
    }
    class ResumeNERPredictor {
        +predict(text: str, minimum_confidence: float, include_tokens: bool) dict[str, Any]
    }
    class ResumeEmbedder {
        +encode(semantic_inputs: list[dict]) dict[str, Any]
    }
    class Adapter {
        <<protocol>>
        +generate(payload: dict) str
    }
    class AdherenceScoreStrategy {
        <<protocol>>
        +version: str
        +compute(details: list[dict], scale: float) tuple[float, float, list[float]]
    }

    TalentMatchPipelineFacade ..> ResumeNERPredictor : extrai entidades
    TalentMatchPipelineFacade ..> ResumeEmbedder : gera embeddings
    TalentMatchPipelineFacade ..> Adapter : carrega e repassa
    TalentMatchPipelineFacade o--> AdherenceScoreStrategy : repassa
    note for TalentMatchPipelineFacade "Cliente: analyze() em app/analysis.py. Também coordena as funções anonymize_for_analysis(), extract_skills(), aggregate_requirement_windows(), compare(), evaluate_batch() e generate_llm_justification()"
